EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}That was a lot of fun, wasn't it?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}We'll have to play again sometime.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}But next time, I'll win!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ha sido muy divertido, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¿verdad?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Pero ya verás como la próxima
vez ganaré yo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çok eğlenceliydi, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir ara yine oynamalıyız.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ama gelecek sefer ben kazanacağım!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}That was so much fun!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm a little
disappointed that we lost,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} but I'm
already planning for next time!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Hoy hemos podido jugar mucho!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hubiera preferido ganar, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}como todo
el mundo, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡pero ha estado muy bien!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}On a pu jouer tout notre saoul
aujourd'hui ! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si seulement j'avais
gagné,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} tout aurait été parfait, hi hi !{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ci siamo divertit{{TAG:000E:0006:0200690002006500}} un sacco{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} oggi!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi dispiace un pochettino aver
